  "suggestion": "Add Escape handler; trap focus inside the modal while open.",
  {% if _v != "terse" %}"reasoning": "Observe: no keyDown handler. Trace: mounted on /settings. Infer: keyboard-only users get stuck. Conclude: P1 — blocks an accessibility audit.",{% endif %}
}
```
